 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Looker (Google Cloud core) API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Instances are configuration metadata: no Looker application, URI, IP address, database or custom domain certificate exists, and instances report ACTIVE immediately. OAuth client secrets are refused and never stored. Deletion is immediate rather than soft, so showDeleted lists nothing extra; undelete, restart, import, export, restore and backups are unimplemented.",
  "title": "Looker (Google Cloud core) (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
